meta {
  name: Delete Folder
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/folders/{{folderId}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Origin: {{clientUrl}}
}

script:post-response {
  if (res.status === 200) {
    bru.setVar("deletedBatchId", res.body.data.deletedBatchId);
  }
}

docs {
  Soft delete. The folder and its whole subtree, notes included, are stamped with
  one shared deletedBatchId, which the response returns and which this request
  stores for the Trash folder.

  Anything already in the trash keeps its original batch, so restoring this one
  later will not resurrect something that was thrown away separately.
}
